  (text "01_Stack_Header J1  [zone: lower-centre, HORIZONTAL 10x2 strip]
Same 2x10 datum (X/Y) as the main board. The SPI spine runs NORTH from here;
buses arrive grouped so each lands next to its zone: SPI -> central spine;
I2C -> PN532 (west); UART -> C5/RV1106/GPS (east)." (at 15 15 0)
